---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import { site } from "../data/site";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About"
  description="Following the Right Direction. Delivering the Right Catch. Guided by honesty, wisdom, and trusted partnerships in every catch."
>
  <section class="relative isolate overflow-hidden bg-navy-950 text-white">
    <img
      src="/images/hero.jpg"
      alt=""
      class="absolute inset-0 h-full w-full object-cover opacity-40"
    />
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-navy-950/55"></div>
    <div class="relative mx-auto max-w-4xl px-5 pb-16 pt-32 text-center md:px-8 md:pt-36">
      <p class="text-sm font-semibold tracking-[0.22em] uppercase text-gold-400">About</p>
      <h1 class="mt-3 font-display text-5xl font-semibold md:text-6xl">Our Mission</h1>
      <div class="diamond-rule mx-auto mt-6 w-36 text-gold-400" aria-hidden="true"><span></span></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="bg-white">
    <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-6xl items-center gap-12 px-5 py-16 md:grid-cols-2 md:px-8 md:py-24">
      <div>
        <p class="text-sm font-semibold tracking-[0.22em] uppercase text-gold-600">Our Mission</p>
        <h2 class="mt-3 font-display text-4xl font-semibold text-navy-800 md:text-5xl">
          {site.tagline}
        </h2>
        <p class="mt-6 text-lg leading-relaxed text-navy-800/85">
          {site.guidedBy}
        </p>
        <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed text-navy-800/80">
          We partner with seafood buyers domestically and globally, providing premium seafood while simplifying the logistics that keep the supply chain moving. We partner with top-tier producers who manage quality, sustainability, and commitment. We can assure quality and commitment from start to finish.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-3xl bg-gradient-to-b from-slate-500/80 to-navy-800 p-6 shadow-xl">
        <img
          src="/images/logo.png"
          alt="Illustrated Cast Right Catch Co. mark with a fishing boat and a full net."
          class="mx-auto w-full max-w-md object-contain"
          loading="lazy"
        />
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="bg-navy-900 text-white">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-5 py-16 text-center md:px-8 md:py-24">
      <p class="text-sm font-semibold tracking-[0.22em] uppercase text-gold-400">Our Name</p>
      <blockquote class="mt-5 font-display text-3xl font-medium leading-snug text-balance md:text-4xl">
        “Cast the net on the right side of the boat.”
      </blockquote>
      <p class="mt-4 text-sm tracking-[0.16em] uppercase text-white/60">John 21</p>
      <p class="mt-8 text-lg leading-relaxed text-white/85">
        Our name, Cast Right Catch Co., was inspired by the account in John 21, where Jesus instructed His disciples to cast their net on the right side of the boat. After a night without success, they trusted His direction, and their nets were filled beyond expectation.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-5 text-lg leading-relaxed text-white/85">
        For us, that story is a reminder that lasting success comes from doing business the right way — with honesty, wisdom, faith, and trusted partnerships. Those principles guide every relationship we build and every customer we serve.
      </p>
      <a href="/contact" class="btn-gold mt-10">Work With Us</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
